      "message": "Might be good to add a comment about why we don\u0027t unmap MMIO here but postpone it until activate_iommu() (to capture the outcome of our brainstorm in https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/3590991/13..18/arch/x86/kvm/vmx/pkvm/pkvm_host.c#b1041)?\n\nBTW this postponing of MMIO unmap is not something that is needed in this patch (for postponing IOMMU initialization), it is related to the next patch aosp/3590991, right? So it rather belongs in a separate patch after this one?",
